湯頭濃郁、麵條彈牙，和小歪一起享受這份幸福滋味。這裡不只是填飽肚子的地方，更像是一場時光旅行，笑聲與美食交織，留下滿滿回憶\n\n#神奇傑克 #小歪 #士林美食 #大小倉大眾酒場 #烤肉 #拉麵 #復古酒場 #台北美食 #魔術師的日常 #狗狗友善",null,[0,158]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16834678661798838703/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhXTVZSVk5XdFpWMVpQVW10R05sVllVbkpaTUZrd1lURk9OVlJWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,6500,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWMVRVNWtZV1ZPUmtGNlVYUnJZMFkwYTFONVRVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xad21fd072235cafb!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlV1TU5kYWVORkF6UXRrY0Y0a1N5TUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWMVRVNWtZV1ZPUmtGNlVYUnJZMFkwYTFONVRVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWMVRVNWtZV1ZPUmtGNlVYUnJZMFkwYTFONVRVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWMVRVNWtZV1ZPUmtGNlVYUnJZMFkwYTFONVRVRRILMGNueTFya2RITF8aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVjFUVTVrWVdWT1JrRjZVWFJyWTBZMGExTjVUVUUSCzBjbnkxcmtkSExfIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR-8o